    "sections": {
        "description": "The Veterinary Pet Wellness theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution designed for veterinary clinics, pet care centers, animal hospitals, pet wellness services, dog and cat care, pet grooming, pet boarding, animal clinics, pet health consultation, and pet therapy services. Ideal for veterinary website templates, pet clinic layouts, animal hospital portals, pet wellness platforms, and pet care service sites, this theme offers a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for banners, service highlights, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, client testimonials, interactive galleries, pet checkups, vaccinations, surgical procedures, grooming packages, pet adoption information, and veterinary team profiles to engage pet owners effectively. Built with clean, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to reflect your clinic’s brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for pet service bookings and product sales, Contact Form 7 for inquiries and appointment requests, and Pet Manager or similar veterinary management plugins, Veterinary Pet Wellness provides a high-performing, professional platform to promote pet healthcare services and enhance online engagement with pet owners."
    },
